tar-icon-default"><path fill="var(--color-neutral400, #CCC)" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 14.108l-3.84 2.594a.5.5 0 01-.757-.563l1.347-4.322-3.688-2.715a.5.5 0 01.286-.902l4.644-.092 1.537-4.293a.5.5 0 01.942 0l1.537 4.293 4.644.092a.5.5 0 01.286.902l-3.688 2.715 1.347 4.322a.5.5 0 01-.757.563L10 14.108z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><svg class="sc-ewnqHT kzRWwi sc-kkscRO loqaXV" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="20" width="20" data-testid="star-icon-default"><path fill="var(--color-neutral400, #CCC)" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 14.108l-3.84 2.594a.5.5 0 01-.757-.563l1.347-4.322-3.688-2.715a.5.5 0 01.286-.902l4.644-.092 1.537-4.293a.5.5 0 01.942 0l1.537 4.293 4.644.092a.5.5 0 01.286.902l-3.688 2.715 1.347 4.322a.5.5 0 01-.757.563L10 14.108z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><div title="26-12-2020 | 02:58" class="parts__CommentDate-sc-52584e87-9 ckvMNP">5 lat temu</div><div class="parts__TooltipWrapper-sc-52584e87-39 gSYfkI"><div data-state="closed" tabindex="0" class="sc-liwHTo iGHYuf"><svg class="sc-ewnqHT kzRWwi parts__InfoIcon-sc-52584e87-38 bHgAin" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="20" width="20"><path d="M10 2a8 8 0 110 16 8 8 0 010-16zm0 1a7 7 0 100 14 7 7 0 000-14zm.5 6a.5.5 0 01.492.41L11 9.5V13h.5a.5.5 0 010 1h-3a.5.5 0 010-1H9v-3h-.5a.5.5 0 01-.09-.992L8.5 9h2zm0-3a.5.5 0 01.5.5v1a.5.5 0 01-.5.5h-1a.5.5 0 01-.5-.5v-1a.5.5 0 01.5-.5h1z"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="parts__CommentBodyWrapper-sc-52584e87-20 kJEaGs"><p class="parts__Text-sc-a2daa554-1 gEIEXJ parts__CommentBody-sc-52584e87-21 iFyZBG"><span><span><span>Tragiczna karta sieciowa. Nie wiem po co produkują taki szrot skoro swojego przeznaczenia w ogóle nie spełnia. Nie można się połączyć z żadną siecią, odrzuca hasła, zasięg 1/5 a w linii prostej 5m do routera... Tragedia. Sterowniki są ale po co skoro nie wnoszą niczego w porównaniu do tych od Microsoft? Nie spodziewałem się cudów po TP-Link ale takiego syfu na rynku bym się na ich miejscu wstydził. Nie polecam. Kupcie coś porządnego ludzie.</span></span><span style="position:fixed;visibility:hidden;top:0;left:0"><span>... </span><span class="parts__ReadMore-sc-a2daa554-0 edjPkn">Rozwiń dalej</span></span></span></p><div class="parts__VoteButtonWrapper-sc-52584e87-24 kSrHKs"><button aria-label="Oceń pozytywnie" type="button" data-disabled="false" width="content" class="sc-duSInm cypsPV sc-crozmw PAhAC parts__VoteButton-sc-52584e87-25 ZzGZn"><svg class="sc-ewnqHT kzRWwi" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="20" width="20"><path d="M20.949 9.948H19.41v.995h1.026c.565 0 1.026.446 1.026.994 0 .55-.461.995-1.026.995h-2.051v.995h1.025c.565 0 1.026.447 1.026.995 0 .549-.46.995-1.026.995H17.36v.994h1.026c.565 0 1.025.447 1.025.995 0 .55-.46.995-1.025.995 0 0-3.87.235-5.129 0-1.355-.253-3.772-1.736-5.128-1.99-1.007-.187-4.102 0-4.102 0V9.948h1.538c2.088 0 6.667-2.005 6.667-7.958 0-.549.46-.995 1.025-.995.385 0 .734.218.935.582 1.054 1.916.338 4.7-.325 5.593l-.585.788h7.668c.565 0 1.025.447 1.025.995 0 .55-.46.995-1.025.995M23 8.953c0-1.097-.92-1.99-2.051-1.99h-5.813c.633-1.452 1.014-3.938-.04-5.855A2.11 2.11 0 0013.255 0c-1.13 0-2.05.892-2.05 1.99 0 5.21-3.875 6.963-5.642 6.963H3v8.953h1.026s3.095-.187 4.102 0c1.356.254 3.773 1.737 5.128 1.99 1.26.234 5.129 0 5.129 0 1.13 0 2.05-.892 2.05-1.99 0-.412-.13-.796-.352-1.113.8-.273 1.379-1.004 1.379-1.871 0-.412-.13-.796-.353-1.113.8-.273 1.378-1.004 1.378-1.872 0-.489-.19-.933-.494-1.28.6-.348 1.007-.978 1.007-1.704" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg><div class="sc-jJTsDX gEtahq">1</div></button><button aria-label="Oceń negatywnie" type="button" data-disabled="false" width="content" class="sc-duSInm cypsPV sc-crozmw PAhAC parts__VoteButton-sc-52584e87-25 ZzGZn"><svg class="sc-ewnqHT kzRWwi" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="20" width="20"><path d="M4.051 14.052c-.565 0-1.025.446-1.025.995 0 .548.46.995 1.025.995h7.668l-.585.788c-.663.8